    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/76c0164b67a94e7d52cf29ac72b23d9d.avif?t=1750962154\" width=800 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face  waves of giant insects, aliens, and zombies in a fight for survival. Customize your build with an arsenal of unique weapons and power-ups, and harness the game's unique planetary perspective to outmaneuver your enemies and turn the tide of battle. How long can you last against the cosmic onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.poster.avif?t=1750962154\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.webm?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.mp4?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a skilled bounty hunter with a powerful tank, hired by planets desperate to reclaim their land from invaders. Your mission: exterminate the monstrous threats and make the planets habitable for settlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For every monster you eliminate, you earn a bounty, which can be used to upgrade your weapons, tank, and abilities\u2014allowing you to tackle even greater challenges and amass even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.poster.avif?t=1750962154\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.webm?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.mp4?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn them with a flamethrower!,\u00a0exterminate them with guided missiles and cannon projectiles!,\u00a0protect from enemy bullets with your energy shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/0dcc5f0c89f012869041ce35f2ac4517.poster.avif?t=1750962154\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/0dcc5f0c89f012869041ce35f2ac4517.webm?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/0dcc5f0c89f012869041ce35f2ac4517.mp4?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete runs and unlock new vehicles with special and unique abilities\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/eb184c5edc97ab27eb30121e41061ab7.poster.avif?t=1750962154\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/eb184c5edc97ab27eb30121e41061ab7.webm?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/eb184c5edc97ab27eb30121e41061ab7.mp4?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin-stick shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real spherical mini planets arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast runs (under 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of weapons and powerups to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to get items from the shop between waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulty levels so everybody can enjoy it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/76c0164b67a94e7d52cf29ac72b23d9d.avif?t=1750962154\" width=800 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face  waves of giant insects, aliens, and zombies in a fight for survival. Customize your build with an arsenal of unique weapons and power-ups, and harness the game's unique planetary perspective to outmaneuver your enemies and turn the tide of battle. How long can you last against the cosmic onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.poster.avif?t=1750962154\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.webm?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/14bf47c2d3e187a475be724f485d68d3.mp4?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a skilled bounty hunter with a powerful tank, hired by planets desperate to reclaim their land from invaders. Your mission: exterminate the monstrous threats and make the planets habitable for settlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For every monster you eliminate, you earn a bounty, which can be used to upgrade your weapons, tank, and abilities\u2014allowing you to tackle even greater challenges and amass even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.poster.avif?t=1750962154\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.webm?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/22ceb8380b931588b61034e4fd9042e1.mp4?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn them with a flamethrower!,\u00a0exterminate them with guided missiles and cannon projectiles!,\u00a0protect from enemy bullets with your energy shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/0dcc5f0c89f012869041ce35f2ac4517.poster.avif?t=1750962154\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/0dcc5f0c89f012869041ce35f2ac4517.webm?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/0dcc5f0c89f012869041ce35f2ac4517.mp4?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete runs and unlock new vehicles with special and unique abilities\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/eb184c5edc97ab27eb30121e41061ab7.poster.avif?t=1750962154\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/eb184c5edc97ab27eb30121e41061ab7.webm?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368550/extras/eb184c5edc97ab27eb30121e41061ab7.mp4?t=1750962154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin-stick shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real spherical mini planets arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast runs (under 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of weapons and powerups to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to get items from the shop between waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulty levels so everybody can enjoy it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Fast-paced, twin sticker, top-down arena shooter with roguelite elements, where you pilot a powerful tank on spherical mini planets to fight hordes of zombies and monsters. Collect your bounty for killing your enemies to get new weapons and powerups to improve your skills.",
